Z||000000||Fierochic88||10-10-2001||02:36 PM||||Well Everyone here's the list of who all made it!  Soon I hope to have the pics labeled on Denny's website so you can all put names to faces!  We had 30 Fiero Owners total (though that doesn't count my grandmother - who "owns" a few herself!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)  Between all of us we had 68 Fieros!<P>In no particular order & what they drove:<P>Dave Horst (Skitime)             \ Red 88 GT<BR>Veronica Houck (Veronica'sV6GT)  / T-Top Mod.<BR>Joe Torma - an ACURA!<BR>Ken Slish (kslish) - an INTRIGUE!<BR>Justin Cohen (Grinthock) - Silver 87 GT Cust.<BR>Bruce Walters (FTFEngineering) - MRM Form. FB<BR>Bob Schlag (Grgyl86?) - came with Denny<BR>Bruce & Illonya Homeyard - Black 88 Coupe<BR>Mark & Karen Hoagland (help?) - Yel 86 3.4 GT<BR>Neil & Dawn Kline - Red 88 T-Top Formula<BR>Denise ? - Black 86 SE<BR>Cory & Cary Watts - Yellow 86 GT Custom<BR>Joe Rebilas (FieroGT914) - White 86 GT <BR>Reese Graves & Anne Graves - MRM 87 GT<BR>Jon Lagler (rockcrawl) - 87 Coupe V8<BR>Jeremy (gold87se?) - MRM 86 GT<BR>Denny Lambert (Denny) - Red 86 GT<BR>Lisa Levine - came with kslish<BR>Don Haag (Haagster) - Black 87 GT<BR>Frank Gonzalez - sweet yellow 86 SE SCCA car<BR>Jason Haughey (fiero38) - red 85 SE 3.8<BR>Rebecca Haughey - red 86 GT<BR>Ryan ? - yellow coupe custom<BR>Jim Gilbert (TooManyFieros) - his masses!<BR>Cyndi Gilbert (AlongfortheRide)<BR>Jamie Gilbert (Fierochik86)<BR>& of course me!<P>If I missed anyone please let me know!  Thanks again everyone for coming!||||reg||1
