Z||000002||kslish||10-10-2001||05:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierochic88:<BR><B>Ken Slish (kslish) - an INTRIGUE!<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yea yea....an Intrigue.  I had to take the new car on its first road trip!  Besides, Lisa seemed to enjoy the extra interior room to sprawl out and "attempt" to sleep.  Also remember Jen, it got us all back and forth to the movies Sat. night.  I'd like to see all 5 of us try to fit in a Fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>And Fierobaby...you didn't look close enough:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P000824.jpg"> <P>I'm an elusive one to be caught on film anyways  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
